{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YVt9yT4DK2myb2cjUaiFpK","type":"tool_result","content":"===NAMES\nAlgebra/BigOperators/Group/Finset/Piecewise.lean:153:theorem prod_ite_eq' [DecidableEq ι] (s : Finset ι) (a : ι) (b : ι → M) :\nAlgebra/BigOperators/Group/List/Basic.lean:214:theorem mul_prod_eraseIdx {i} (hlen : i < l.length) (hcomm : ∀ a' ∈ l.take i, Commute l[i] a') :\nAlgebra/BigOperators/Group/Finset/Basic.lean:749:theorem mul_prod_erase [DecidableEq ι] (s : Finset ι) (f : ι → M) {a : ι} (h : a ∈ s) :\nAlgebra/BigOperators/Finsupp/Basic.lean:121:theorem prod_ite_eq' [DecidableEq α] (f : α →₀ M) (a : α) (b : α → M → N) :\nAlgebra/BigOperators/Finsupp/Basic.lean:155:theorem mul_prod_erase (f : α →₀ M) (y : α) (g : α → M → N) (hyf : y ∈ f.support) :\nAlgebra/BigOperators/Finsupp/Basic.lean:170:theorem mul_prod_erase' (f : α →₀ M) (y : α) (g : α → M → N) (hg : ∀ i : α, g i 0 = 1) :\n===PYFMINUS\ndef components(adj: list[int], support_only: bool = True) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"Connected components as vertex masks; by default only those of the\n    support (vertices of positive degree), so isolated vertices are skipped.\"\"\"\n    n = len(adj)\n    seen = 0\n    out = []\n    for v in range(n):\n        if (seen >> v) & 1:\n            continue\n        if support_only and adj[v] == 0:\n            continue\n        comp = 1 << v\n        frontier = 1 << v\n        while frontier:\n            nxt = 0\n            for u in bits(frontier):\n                nxt |= adj[u]\n            nxt &= ~comp\n            comp |= nxt\n            frontier = nxt\n        seen |= comp\n        out.append(comp)\n    return out\n\ndef f_potential(adj: list[int]) -> Fraction:\n    \"\"\"`f(G) = Σ_v g(d(v))` (the paper's `f_α`, `α = 1/6`).\"\"\"\n    return histogram_term(adj)\n\n\ndef fminus(adj: list[int]) -> Fraction:\n    \"\"\"`f⁻(G) = f(G) − Σ_{components C of the support} g'(δ(C))` (paper p. 7,\n    per component, as the Lean design fixes it